# default: no facade binary and no job path links this crate, a build
# without the feature carries no product client, and only
# registry-breg-client is admitted while the crate is parked. The
# connector needs a runtime to run its client's async exchanges under the
# synchronous operation contract, so the feature carries the smallest
# tokio runtime slice.
